<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-10.webp" width="940" height="762" alt="你可以用搜尋功能幫你快速找到這個動作" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>你可以用搜尋功能幫你快速找到這個<strong>動作</strong></figcaption>
</figure>

<h3 id="step-4--選擇你要接收哪個表單的資訊">STEP 4 : 選擇你要接收哪個表單的資訊<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-4--%e9%81%b8%e6%93%87%e4%bd%a0%e8%a6%81%e6%8e%a5%e6%94%b6%e5%93%aa%e5%80%8b%e8%a1%a8%e5%96%ae%e7%9a%84%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-11.webp" width="940" height="520" alt="回應識別碼選擇預設的即可" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
