<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-13.webp" width="940" height="689" alt="STEP 6: 填寫主管簽核時會看到的內容（圖 13）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
