<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-14.webp" width="940" height="528" alt="STEP 6 : 新步驟，建立簽核觸發條件（圖 14）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
