<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-15.webp" width="710" height="295" alt="STEP 6 : 用簽核結果來處理接下來流程（圖 15）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
