<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202010/power-automate-simple-example/images/power-automate-simple-example-18.webp" width="632" height="526" alt="STEP 8 : 如果簽核結果為否，就回 email 說明（圖 18）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
